# Cavalier of Thorns dies to Bot2's Infernal Grasp on turn 2 (Bot2 sacrificed its own Black Lotus first, so an opponent's
# graveyard card exists). Its trigger targets another card in Bot1's graveyard only: not the Cavalier itself and not Bot2's
# Lotus (CR 115.1, 400.7). Accepting exiles the Cavalier and puts the target, the Ornithopter the enter trigger buried,
# on top of the library. The Island stays in the graveyard.
